Wild mushrooms from Eastern Black Sea Region (Türkiye): Element
concentrations and their health risk assessment
Ali KELEŞ1 , Hüseyin GENÇCELEP2*
Yüzüncü Yıl University, Education Faculty, Department of Mathematics and Science Education, Van, Türkiye
Ondokuz Mayıs University, Engineering Faculty, Department of Food Engineering, Samsun, Türkiye
