3.5 Miscellaneous
Turmeric is a common spice popularly used in cooking in almost all families in Bangladesh as a yellow colorant in food. However, very little has been
reported on Pb concentration in turmeric grown in
Bangladesh. The first study in 1987 reported Pb
concentration in Bangladeshi grown turmeric, and
